  "description": "The proposed scheme comprises an 18-panel (8.82 kWp) solar PV array to be installed on the building’s flat roof. The design has been carefully considered to integrate sensitively with the existing roofscape and has been positioned to ensure no impact on the character or visual amenity of the surrounding area, with the array being entirely screened from public viewpoints. \n\nThe proposal forms part of this local employer’s wider sustainability objectives to reduce carbon emissions and improve on-site renewable energy generation.\n\nThe goal is to seamlessly integrate sustainable technology into the existing architectural landscape, without affecting the aesthetics of the surrounding area. This approach reflects our commitment to environmental responsibility while respecting the historical and visual context of the neighbourhood.",
